committer zichuanxu <zichuanxu28@gmail.com> 1792187153 +0900

Response cache: the first reply stored wins (INSERT OR IGNORE) and every concurrent poster of a request uses the stored reply; before, the last writer won and each poster kept its own reply, so concurrent processes (stage-4 M2 with the E2 warm-up) and the per-world clients of one E1 run (world-independent D1s program requests) used replies the cache no longer held

